      9 index 30 index add 0.5 mul
      9 index 30 index add 0.5 mul
      9 index 30 index add 0.5 mul
      5 copy 5 copy 35 5 roll 25 5 roll 15 5 roll
      4 index 10 index add 0.5 mul
